{
  "version": "0.9.8",
  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.8\n\n## 新功能\n\n- 运行环境新增 Harness 版本列表，可查询官方 npm 发布记录，选择精确版本安装、升级或降级。\n- 安装时使用独立目录和临时官方 Profile 验证启动及 Host 协议，通过后才替换当前运行时。\n\n## 变更与安全\n\n- 将 Rustls 更新至 `0.23.45`，修复 TLS 握手边界校验漏洞 `RUSTSEC-2026-0285`。\n- 保留最近成功验证的版本，兼容旧版运行时标记；「修复」继续使用该版本。\n- 安装期间阻止插件修改，失败时保留原运行时、Profile 与会话，可重新启动原版本。\n- 新版登录 token 不再被启动解析丢弃，日志与托盘不展示凭证。\n\n## 修复与打磨\n\n- 修复选择旧版本时子包仍被解析为较新版本，导致缺少导出或 peer 服务的问题。\n- 增加新版 CLI 导出入口兼容，处理旧 Node 缺少 `import.meta.main` 时的静默退出。\n- 版本查询失败显示错误弹窗，可重试并保留已有列表；启动兼容性失败显示具体原因。\n\n## 安装与已知限制\n\n- 可覆盖安装或通过应用检查更新。需要离线安装时选择 Full，Lite 在首次运行时下载依赖。\n- 当前 Studio 基线仍为 `0.1.1-rc.2`。版本列表不等于全部兼容：`0.1.2-rc.1`、`0.1.5-rc.2` 的严格登录 Cookie 与内嵌界面不兼容，会被安全拒绝并保留原运行时。\n- 不手动修改托管运行时的 node_modules；第三方插件仍需满足所选版本的兼容要求。\n\n## 验证\n\n- Windows 完成基线冷安装、`0.1.1-rc.1` 选择安装与真实 Profile 启动；浏览器实测确认并拦截严格 Cookie 的内嵌登录问题。\n- 增加三平台 CI 启动与拒绝不兼容版本回归。没有苹果实体设备，macOS 以 CI 检查和后续用户反馈为依据。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.8\n\n## New features\n\n- Query official Harness releases and install an exact selected version with isolated installation and real Profile/Host startup verification.\n- Preserve the last verified selection, legacy runtime markers, and the previous runtime when a candidate fails.\n\n## Fixes and security\n\n- Update Rustls to `0.23.45`, fixing TLS handshake boundary validation advisory `RUSTSEC-2026-0285`.\n- Pin Harness family packages and required peers together, preventing mixed-version export failures during downgrades.\n- Serialize installation against plugin mutations, report catalog/compatibility errors, and support newer exported CLI entry points on older Node releases.\n- Preserve bootstrap tokens for navigation while redacting logs and tray labels. Authentication is never disabled.\n\n## Installation and limitations\n\n- Upgrade in place or use the in-app updater; Full includes offline dependencies, while Lite downloads them when needed.\n- The Studio baseline remains `0.1.1-rc.2`. Strict-cookie releases including `0.1.2-rc.1` and `0.1.5-rc.2` are rejected because the current embedded window cannot authenticate them. Existing runtime and user data are retained.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Windows cold baseline install and selected `0.1.1-rc.1` Profile startup were exercised; browser testing reproduced the strict-cookie embedding failure.\n- Three-platform CI now includes selected-version boot and incompatible-version rejection. No physical Apple device was available for validation.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
